      {
        "sourceId": "eval_001",
        "text": "ACE's structured, turn-by-turn feedback led to a statistically meaningful gain in negotiation outcomes between trials, whereas GPT-4's zero-shot feedback did not move the needle.",
        "kind": "near_duplicate",
        "distance": 0.0998
      },
      {
        "sourceId": "eval_003",
        "text": "Rehearsal's simulated-conflict rehearsal cut competitive tactics by roughly two-thirds and about doubled cooperative moves in a genuine, unassisted follow-up conflict.",
